  "description": "Regen Hagart discovers her dead genius Royal alchemist aunt's recipe of the Dream Potion which allows the contractor to enter the drinker's dream. Hoping to hold her crush, Daniel's hands at least in her dreams, Regen creates the potion. However, Kaiden Roose, her long time Royal Academy rival accidentally ends up drinking the potion. The effect of the potion was suppose to last for one dream but Regen keeps on entering and appearing in Kaiden's dreams. What will happen to these two?\n\n(Source: Pocket Comics)",
